      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, when this happens, the block becomes unreadable (hash check will fail) and can only be recovered a successful re-write of the entire block.\n\nWithin the writer, you could try writing something that would be consistent, try to update the hash to match what you actually managed to write or signal to the caller that this specific situation occurred so they know how to try and recover it.",
